{% extends "base.txt.jinja2" %}

{% block content %}
Your mailbox {{ mailbox.email }} and alias {{alias.email}} cannot have the same domain.

The alias domain should point to {{ BRAND_NAME }} servers so emails sent to it are forwarded by {{ BRAND_NAME }}.

The mailbox domain should be your "final" email address that can receive emails from {{ BRAND_NAME }}
    and cannot point to {{ BRAND_NAME }}.

Please either
- update the mailbox to a final email address in the app
- remove {{alias.email}} domain from your custom domains
{% endblock %}
